ependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n- v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n- v4.5.dev5.official [64b09905c]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.19045 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7247) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6400 CPU @ 2.70GHz (4 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen an invisible GraphNode is inside the GraphEdit you can still grab it and move it around instead as long as there is no other GraphNode in the same position.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d88f8f1c-f8e3-4aa4-8463-53ed817ad60c\n\nThey can also be moved by selecting the invisible ones via click-and-drag and moving a visible one.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1d488db-a422-4faa-8240-88bf3dab0be2\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a GraphNode inside a GraphEdit.\n2. Make the GraphNode invisible.\n3. Click and drag the area where the GraphNode last was visible.\n4. You'll be dragging the graphnode around.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug_testing_4-4.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20640117/bug_testing_4-4.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":